            {
              "content": "=You are a lead processing AI.\n\nYour task:\n1. Classify the intent into one of these EXACT values:\n   - sales\n   - support\n   - spam\n\n2. Extract the following fields from the message:\n   - name (person name if mentioned)\n   - company (company name if mentioned)\n   - requirement (short summary of what they want)\n\nRules:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Do NOT wrap in markdown.\n- Do NOT include explanations.\n- If a value is missing, set it to null.\n- Always return all four fields.\n\nExample output format:\n{\n  \"intent\": \"sales\",\n  \"name\": \"Karim\",\n  \"company\": \"XYZ Corp\",\n  \"requirement\": \"enterprise pricing\"\n}\n\nMessage:\n{{$json.body.message}}"
            }
