            {
              "content": "=You are a professional sales representative.\nWrite a concise, natural, professional reply email based ONLY on the information below.\n\nCustomer Name: {{ $json.name }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nRequirement: {{ $json.requirement }}\n\nRules:\n- Do NOT use placeholders like [Name] or [Company]\n- Do NOT include meta text like \"Here is your reply\"\n- Do NOT include markdown or separators\n- Do NOT invent features that were not mentioned\n- Do NOT write generic marketing fluff\n- Keep it under 120 words\n- Be direct and specific to the requirement\n- If name is null, start with \"Hi,\" instead of using a name\n- End with a short clear next step\n\nOutput only the final email text."
